  ("Slack lets emacs-slack in with the token and the cookie its web app signs in with.  To find them, sign in to your workspace in Chrome or Firefox, then:\n\n1.  Open my.slack.com/customize, with Open Slack's Page below.\n\n2.  Open the browser's developer tools, Inspect in the page's context menu, and their Console.  There type\n\n        window.prompt(\"Token\", TS.boot_data.api_token)\n\n    and copy the token it shows, which starts with xoxc-.\n\n3.  In the developer tools' Application tab (Storage in Firefox), under Cookies, find the cookie named d and copy its value as it is shown, not decoded.  Copy the cookies d-s and lc too, and put them together as\n\n        xoxd-…; d-s=…; lc=…\n\n4.  Press Add Workspace…, then give the workspace's name, as in NAME.slack.com, your email there, the token and the cookie.\n\nThey are kept with auth-source, in the first of your auth-sources (~/.authinfo, unless you said another); auth-source asks before it writes there.  Anyone who reads them can read and write in Slack as you: keep them in an encrypted ~/.authinfo.gpg, or in the macOS Keychain." . "Slack 允許 emacs-slack 使用其網頁版登入時所用的權杖和 Cookie 登入。要找到它們，請先在 Chrome 或 Firefox 中登入你的工作區，然後：\n\n1.  用下方的「打開 Slack 頁面」打開 my.slack.com/customize。\n\n2.  打開瀏覽器的開發者工具（頁面快速鍵選單中的「檢查」），再打開其中的「主控台」。在那裡輸入\n\n        window.prompt(\"Token\", TS.boot_data.api_token)\n\n    然後拷貝它顯示的權杖，開頭為 xoxc-。\n\n3.  在開發者工具的「應用程式」標籤頁（Firefox 中為「儲存空間」）的 Cookie 下，找到名為 d 的 Cookie，照它顯示的樣子拷貝其值，不要解碼。也拷貝 Cookie d-s 和 lc，並組合成\n\n        xoxd-…; d-s=…; lc=…\n\n4.  按下「加入工作區…」，然後提供工作區的名稱（如 NAME.slack.com）、你在該處的電子郵件、權杖和 Cookie。\n\n它們會透過 auth-source 保存在你的第一個 auth-sources 中（除非你另有指定，否則為 ~/.authinfo）；auth-source 寫入前會先詢問。任何讀到它們的人都能以你的身分在 Slack 中讀寫訊息：請將它們保存在加密的 ~/.authinfo.gpg 或 macOS 鑰匙圈中。")
  ("Open Slack's Page" . "打開 Slack 頁面")
