  ("Telega talks to Telegram through TDLib, Telegram's library,\nof version %s or later, which Homebrew installs:\n\n%s\n\nIt builds it from its latest sources, which takes a while." . "Telega 透過 Telegram 的程式庫 TDLib 與 Telegram 溝通，\n需要 %s 或以上版本，可由 Homebrew 安裝：\n\n%s\n\n它會從最新的原始碼建置 TDLib，需要一段時間。")
  ("The TDLib installed, %s, is older than the %s Telega needs.\nInstall its latest sources over it, in Terminal:\n\n%s\n\nThen check again." . "已安裝的 TDLib %s 比 Telega 需要的 %s 舊。\n請在「終端機」中用最新的原始碼覆蓋安裝：\n\n%s\n\n然後再檢查一次。")
  ("Telega builds telega-server, its program talking to Telegram,\nwith a C compiler, which Apple's command line tools install:\n\n%s" . "Telega 用 C 編譯器建置 telega-server，即它與 Telegram 溝通的程式，\nC 編譯器可由 Apple 的命令列工具安裝：\n\n%s")
  ("TDLib is installed.  Telega now builds telega-server,\nits program talking to Telegram, once: it takes a minute.\nThen it signs in with your phone number." . "TDLib 已安裝。Telega 現在會建置一次 telega-server，\n即它與 Telegram 溝通的程式，大約需要一分鐘。\n然後它會以你的電話號碼登入。")
