  ("LispM is a desktop for coding agents, made of Emacs.  This guide shows it to you a part at a time, and circles each part in red as it speaks of it." . "LispM 是以 Emacs 打造、為程式設計代理而設的桌面。本指南會一次為你介紹一個部分，並在說明時以紅圈標出該部分。")
  ("the next step" . "下一步")
  ("the step before" . "上一步")
  ("puts the guide away" . "收起指南")
  ("brings it back, from anywhere" . "在任何地方再次叫出指南")
  ("The λ menu" . "λ 選單")
  ("LispM's own menu, at the left end of the menu bar, as the Apple menu was: a new agent session, a shell, the App Store and the control panels." . "LispM 自己的選單，位於選單列的最左端，就像昔日的蘋果選單：新的代理工作階段、Shell、App Store 和控制台。")
  ("opens the menu bar from the keyboard; C-f and C-b go to the menu beside" . "從鍵盤打開選單列；C-f 和 C-b 可移到旁邊的選單")
  ("The application in front" . "最前方的應用程式")
  ("The menus after the λ are those of the application in front, this guide's now: File and Go.  The Application menu, at the right end, names it and lists the others, to bring one forward." . "λ 之後的選單屬於最前方的應用程式，目前是本指南的選單：「檔案」和「前往」。位於最右端的應用程式選單會顯示它的名稱，並列出其他應用程式，讓你將其中一個移到最前方。")
  ("brings the next application forward" . "將下一個應用程式移到最前方")
  ("The desktop's icons" . "桌面圖像")
  ("They stand down the right edge.  A click selects one, a double click opens it, and one dragged stays where it is dropped.  Home is your home folder, in a Finder window." . "它們沿著右側邊緣排列。按一下可選取，按兩下可打開，拖移後會停在放下的位置。「個人專屬」是你的個人專屬檔案夾，會在 Finder 視窗中打開。")
  ("select the next icon or the one before, while the desktop has the keyboard" . "在桌面接收鍵盤輸入時，選取下一個或上一個圖像")
  ("opens the icon selected" . "打開所選的圖像")
  ("Where the work is done: a workspace for each project, with its files, its terminals and its agents, and a sidebar listing them.  It fills the screen, or floats over the desktop as Show Me opens it; its zoom box switches." . "工作的地方：每個專案各有一個工作區，包含它的檔案、終端機和代理，並有一個列出它們的側邊欄。它可以佔滿螢幕，也可以像「示範給我看」打開它時那樣浮在桌面上；按它的縮放框即可切換。")
  ("starts a LispM agent in the project" . "在專案中啟動 LispM 代理")
  ("shows the agents" . "顯示代理")
  ("opens a terminal" . "打開終端機")
  ("The browser" . "瀏覽器")
  ("The web, dressed as Netscape Communicator: tabs, bookmarks and history, and pages followed from the keyboard." . "換上 Netscape Communicator 外貌的網頁：標籤頁、書籤和瀏覽記錄，還能用鍵盤點選頁面中的連結。")
  ("goes to the location field" . "移到位置欄位")
  ("opens a new tab" . "打開新標籤頁")
  ("labels a page's links, to follow the one typed" . "為頁面中的連結加上標籤，輸入標籤即可前往該連結")
  ("The App Store" . "App Store")
  ("Applications and extensions to install: games, news, music and more agents.  The applications installed are in the Applications folder." . "可安裝的應用程式和延伸功能：遊戲、新聞、音樂和更多代理。已安裝的應用程式位於「應用程式」檔案夾中。")
  ("searches the App Store" . "搜尋 App Store")
  ("opens the selected item's page, DEL goes back" . "打開所選項目的頁面，DEL 返回")
  ("The Control Strip" . "控制列")
  ("Settings at hand, in the corner: the appearance, the desktop's picture, the keyboard and the Internet.  The Control Panels icon holds every setting." . "位於角落、隨手可用的設定：外觀、桌面圖片、鍵盤和網際網路。「控制台」圖像包含所有設定。")
  ("goes to the strip: C-f and C-b to a module, RET opens it" . "移到控制列：C-f 和 C-b 移到模組，RET 打開它")
  ("hides the strip, or shows it again" . "隱藏控制列，或再次顯示")
  ("Windows" . "視窗")
  ("This window is like every other: its title bar drags it, the box at the left closes it, the one at the right rolls it up into its title bar, and the corner at the bottom right sizes it.  A zoom box, where there is one, fills the screen with the window." . "這個視窗和其他視窗一樣：拖移標題列可移動它，按左側的方框可關閉它，按右側的方框可將它收合至標題列，拖移右下角可調整大小。若有縮放框，按下它可讓視窗佔滿螢幕。")
  ("hides the desktop in the Dock, its windows out on your screen" . "將桌面隱藏到 Dock 中，它的視窗則留在你的螢幕上")
  ("Emacs, as ever" . "一如既往的 Emacs")
  ("Emacs's own keys work everywhere, as they always did.  This guide is an application of its own: it waits in the Applications folder, the λ menu and the desktop's Help menu whenever you want it again." . "Emacs 自己的按鍵在任何地方都和以往一樣可用。本指南本身就是一個應用程式：日後想再看時，可在「應用程式」檔案夾、λ 選單和桌面的「輔助說明」選單中找到它。")
